          "message_id": "43e08051-33d9-44e3-9939-a46153973679",
          "content": "Perfect! I've successfully completed the **Core Development** phase:\n\n✅ **Core Development - COMPLETED**\n\n**Created modules:**\n\n1. **`plugins/s3_checkpoint_reader.py`** - S3 checkpoint reader with:\n   - S3 path parsing and file listing\n   - Checkpoint content parsing (handles the JSON format you provided)\n   - Support for multiple checkpoint folders\n   - Robust error handling and logging\n\n2. **`plugins/kafka_offset_committer.py`** - Kafka offset committer with:\n   - MSK-optimized connection configuration\n   - Multiple topic support\n   - Offset validation and commit functionality\n   - Connection management with context manager support\n\n3. **`plugins/config_manager.py`** - Configuration management with:\n   - Airflow Variables integration\n   - Support for MSK broker strings, S3 paths, and Kafka topics\n   - JSON and comma-separated string parsing\n   - Configuration validation and caching\n\n4. **`dags/spark_checkpoint_monitor_dag.py`** - Main DAG with:\n   - 4-task workflow: validate → read → commit → report\n   - Comprehensive error handling and logging\n   - XCom data passing between tasks\n   - 15-minute schedule with proper retry logic\n\n**Key Features Implemented:**\n- ✅ Multiple S3 checkpoint folder support\n- ✅ Multiple Kafka topic support  \n- ✅ MWAA 2.10.13 compatibility\n- ✅ Airflow Variables for configuration\n- ✅ Robust error handling and logging\n- ✅ Proper offset format handling (your JSON sample format)\n\nShould I proceed with the next phase - **Testing & Validation** - to create unit tests and validation scripts?"
