        "ToolUse": {
          "message_id": "dc80bf9e-142c-4a27-a463-fc28e598128b",
          "content": "",
          "tool_uses": [
            {
              "id": "tooluse_XHkumhivTCCIARDXbC5PKQ",
              "name": "fs_write",
              "orig_name": "fs_write",
              "args": {
                "summary": "Update minimal configuration example in documentation",
                "path": "/Users/zhwenhao/qchatlog/EnhancedSparkConsumerMonitor/docs/airflow_variables_config.md",
                "new_str": "```bash\n# Required variables\nairflow variables set msk_broker_string \"b-1.zhwenhaomsk.88je25.c5.kafka.us-east-1.amazonaws.com:9092,b-2.zhwenhaomsk.88je25.c5.kafka.us-east-1.amazonaws.com:9092\"\nairflow variables set s3_checkpoint_paths '[\"s3://zhwenhaodatalake/checkpoints/stockprice/offsets/\"]'\nairflow variables set kafka_topics '[\"stockprice\"]'\n\n# Consumer group mapping (NEW - specify consumer group per topic)\nairflow variables set kafka_consumer_group_mapping '{\"stockprice\": \"spark-stock-monitor\"}'\n```\n\n## Behavior\n\n### Multiple Consumer Group Support:\n- **Primary**: Uses `kafka_consumer_group_mapping` to assign specific consumer groups to topics\n- **Fallback**: If mapping not provided, uses `kafka_consumer_group` for all topics\n- **Validation**: System validates all consumer groups can connect to Kafka\n- **Isolation**: Each consumer group maintains independent offset tracking\n\n### Benefits:\n- **Topic Isolation**: Different applications can track offsets independently\n- **Parallel Processing**: Multiple consumer groups can process same topics\n- **Flexible Configuration**: Mix of shared and dedicated consumer groups\n- **Backward Compatibility**: Works with existing single consumer group setups",
                "old_str": "```bash\n# Required variables for your setup\nairflow variables set msk_broker_string \"b-1.zhwenhaomsk.88je25.c5.kafka.us-east-1.amazonaws.com:9092,b-2.zhwenhaomsk.88je25.c5.kafka.us-east-1.amazonaws.com:9092\"\n\nairflow variables set s3_checkpoint_paths '[\"s3://zhwenhaodatalake/checkpoints/stockprice/offsets/\"]'\n\nairflow variables set kafka_topics '[\"stockprice\"]'\n```\n\n## Key Points:\n\n1. **MSK Broker String**: Your exact broker addresses (comma-separated)\n2. **S3 Paths**: JSON array format recommended, supports multiple checkpoint folders\n3. **Kafka Topics**: JSON array format, should match topics in your checkpoint data\n4. **Optional**: Consumer group defaults to `spark-checkpoint-monitor`\n5. **Optional**: AWS region defaults to `us-east-1`\n\n## For MWAA Environment Variables (Alternative):",
                "command": "str_replace"
              },
              "orig_args": {
