        "Response": {
          "message_id": "ff5fd8a6-0b96-438c-9b95-14530942ce88",
          "content": "Perfect! I've successfully enhanced the system to support **multiple consumer groups** with variable-based configuration:\n\n## ✅ **Multiple Consumer Group Support - COMPLETED**\n\n### **Key Enhancements:**\n\n1. **`MultiConsumerGroupKafkaCommitter` Class** - New class that manages multiple `KafkaOffsetCommitter` instances\n2. **Enhanced Configuration Manager** - Added methods for consumer group mapping and validation\n3. **Updated DAG Logic** - Now uses multiple consumer groups for offset commits\n4. **Updated Documentation** - Comprehensive examples for both single and multiple consumer group setups\n\n### **New Configuration Options:**\n\n**Primary (Multiple Consumer Groups):**\n```bash\nairflow variables set kafka_consumer_group_mapping '{\"stockprice\": \"spark-stock-monitor\"}'\n```\n\n**Fallback (Single Consumer Group):**\n```bash\nairflow variables set kafka_consumer_group \"spark-checkpoint-monitor\"\n```\n\n### **Configuration Examples:**\n\n**For your current setup:**\n```bash\n# Required\nairflow variables set msk_broker_string \"b-1.zhwenhaomsk.88je25.c5.kafka.us-east-1.amazonaws.com:9092,b-2.zhwenhaomsk.88je25.c5.kafka.us-east-1.amazonaws.com:9092\"\nairflow variables set s3_checkpoint_paths '[\"s3://zhwenhaodatalake/checkpoints/stockprice/offsets/\"]'\nairflow variables set kafka_topics '[\"stockprice\"]'\n\n# Consumer group mapping (NEW)\nairflow variables set kafka_consumer_group_mapping '{\"stockprice\": \"spark-stock-monitor\"}'\n```\n\n**For multiple topics with different consumer groups:**\n```bash\nairflow variables set kafka_consumer_group_mapping '{\n  \"stockprice\": \"spark-stock-monitor\",\n  \"userdata\": \"spark-user-monitor\", \n  \"transactions\": \"spark-transaction-monitor\"\n}'\n```\n\n### **Key Features:**\n- ✅ **Topic-specific consumer groups** - Each topic can have its own consumer group\n- ✅ **Backward compatibility** - Falls back to single consumer group if mapping not provided\n- ✅ **Independent offset tracking** - Each consumer group maintains separate offsets\n- ✅ **Comprehensive logging** - Shows which consumer groups are used for each topic\n- ✅ **Validation** - Ensures all consumer groups can connect to Kafka\n\nShould I proceed with the next phase - **Testing & Validation** - to create unit tests and validation scripts?"
        }
      }
