    "Perfect! I've created the task.md file with the corrected project structure showing requirements.txt in the requirements/ folder. The task breakdown is now ready and includes:\n\n- Proper folder structure with requirements/ directory\n- Sequential tasks from project setup through deployment\n- Technical specifications for your Spark checkpoint and MSK setup\n- Clear progress tracking with checkboxes\n- Strategy to manage context overflow during development\n\nWould you like me to start with the first task - creating the organized folder structure (dags/, plugins/, requirements/, docs/, test/) and the initial project files?\n[Tool uses: none]",
