    "Perfect! I've successfully completed the project structure setup:\n\n✅ **Project Structure Setup - COMPLETED**\n- Created organized folder structure: `dags/`, `plugins/`, `requirements/`, `docs/`, `test/`\n- Initialized Python package structure with `__init__.py` in plugins\n- Created comprehensive `README.md` with project overview\n- Created `requirements/requirements.txt` with MWAA 2.10.13 compatible dependencies:\n  - kafka-python==2.0.2\n  - boto3>=1.26.0\n  - botocore>=1.29.0\n  - typing-extensions>=4.0.0\n\nThe project structure is now ready. Should I proceed with the next phase - **Core Development** - starting with developing the S3 checkpoint reader module to parse Spark streaming offsets?\n[Tool uses: none]",
