    "\n[Tool uses: fs_write]",
    "Perfect! I've successfully enhanced the system to support **multiple consumer groups** with variable-based configuration:\n\n## ✅ **Multiple Consumer Group Support - COMPLETED**\n\n### **Key Enhancements:**\n\n1. **`MultiConsumerGroupKafkaCommitter` Class** - New class that manages multiple `KafkaOffsetCommitter` instances\n2. **Enhanced Configuration Manager** - Added methods for consumer group mapping and validation\n3. **Updated DAG Logic** - Now uses multiple consumer groups for offset commits\n4. **Updated Documentation** - Comprehensive examples for both single and multiple consumer group setups\n\n### **New Configuration Options:**\n\n**Primary (Multiple Consumer Groups):**\n```bash\nairflow variables set kafka_consumer_group_mapping '{\"stockprice\": \"spark-stock-monitor\"}'\n```\n\n**Fallback (Single Consumer Group):**\n```bash\nairflow variables set kafka_consumer_group \"spark-checkpoint-monitor\"\n```\n\n### **Configuration Examples:**\n\n**For your current setup:**\n```bash\n# Required\nairflow variables set msk_broker_string \"b-1.zhwenhaomsk.88je25.c5.kafka.us-east-1.amazonaws.com:9092,b-2.zhwenhaomsk.88je25.c5.kafka.us-east-1.amazonaws.com:9092\"\nairflow variables set s3_checkpoint_paths '[\"s3://zhwenhaodatalake/checkpoints/stockprice/offsets/\"]'\nairflow variables set kafka_topics '[\"stockprice\"]'\n\n# Consumer group mapping (NEW)\nairflow variables set kafka_consumer_group_mapping '{\"stockprice\": \"spark-stock-monitor\"}'\n```\n\n**For multiple topics with different consumer groups:**\n```bash\nairflow variables set kafka_consumer_group_mapping '{\n  \"stockprice\": \"spark-stock-monitor\",\n  \"userdata\": \"spark-user-monitor\", \n  \"transactions\": \"spark-transaction-monitor\"\n}'\n```\n\n### **Key Features:**\n- ✅ **Topic-specific consumer groups** - Each topic can have its own consumer group\n- ✅ **Backward compatibility** - Falls back to single consumer group if mapping not provided\n- ✅ **Independent offset tracking** - Each consumer group maintains separate offsets\n- ✅ **Comprehensive logging** - Shows which consumer groups are used for each topic\n- ✅ **Validation** - Ensures all consumer groups can connect to Kafka\n\nShould I proceed with the next phase - **Testing & Validation** - to create unit tests and validation scripts?\n[Tool uses: none]",
    "> 請參考以下場景，如果我有兩個spark streaming application 分別為sp1 和sp2 (你可以視為兩個不同的consumer group), 這兩個application checkpoint folder 不相同，kafka topic 為 stockprice. 根據現在的代碼，這場景該如何配置變數呢? ",
    "根據您的場景，我來分析一下配置方式：\n\n## 場景分析：\n- **兩個 Spark Streaming 應用**: sp1 和 sp2\n- **不同的 checkpoint folders**: 各自有獨立的 S3 checkpoint 路徑\n- **相同的 Kafka topic**: stockprice\n- **不同的 consumer groups**: sp1 和 sp2\n\n## 當前代碼的限制：\n\n目前的代碼設計有一個限制：**一個 DAG 實例只能處理一個 consumer group mapping**。對於您的場景，需要以下配置方式：\n\n## 解決方案 1：單一 DAG 處理（推薦）\n\n如果兩個應用的 checkpoint 可以合併處理：\n\n```bash\n# S3 checkpoint paths - 包含兩個應用的路徑\nairflow variables set s3_checkpoint_paths '[\n  \"s3://zhwenhaodatalake/checkpoints/sp1/stockprice/offsets/\",\n  \"s3://zhwenhaodatalake/checkpoints/sp2/stockprice/offsets/\"\n]'\n\n# Kafka topics\nairflow variables set kafka_topics '[\"stockprice\"]'\n\n# MSK broker string\nairflow variables set msk_broker_string \"b-1.zhwenhaomsk.88je25.c5.kafka.us-east-1.amazonaws.com:9092,b-2.zhwenhaomsk.88je25.c5.kafka.us-east-1.amazonaws.com:9092\"\n\n# Consumer group mapping - 但這裡有問題！\n# 目前代碼只支持 topic -> consumer group 的映射\n# 無法區分同一個 topic 的不同 checkpoint 來源\nairflow variables set kafka_consumer_group_mapping '{\"stockprice\": \"sp1\"}'  # 只能選擇一個\n```\n\n## 解決方案 2：部署兩個獨立的 DAG（建議）\n\n創建兩個獨立的 DAG 實例，每個處理一個應用：\n\n### DAG 1 (處理 sp1):\n```bash\n# 變數名稱加上前綴區分\nairflow variables set sp1_msk_broker_string \"b-1.zhwenhaomsk.88je25.c5.kafka.us-east-1.amazonaws.com:9092,b-2.zhwenhaomsk.88je25.c5.kafka.us-east-1.amazonaws.com:9092\"\nairflow variables set sp1_s3_checkpoint_paths '[\"s3://zhwenhaodatalake/checkpoints/sp1/stockprice/offsets/\"]'\nairflow variables set sp1_kafka_topics '[\"stockprice\"]'\nairflow variables set sp1_kafka_consumer_group_mapping '{\"stockprice\": \"sp1\"}'\n```\n\n### DAG 2 (處理 sp2):\n```bash\nairflow variables set sp2_msk_broker_string \"b-1.zhwenhaomsk.88je25.c5.kafka.us-east-1.amazonaws.com:9092,b-2.zhwenhaomsk.88je25.c5.kafka.us-east-1.amazonaws.com:9092\"\nairflow variables set sp2_s3_checkpoint_paths '[\"s3://zhwenhaodatalake/checkpoints/sp2/stockprice/offsets/\"]'\nairflow variables set sp2_kafka_topics '[\"stockprice\"]'\nairflow variables set sp2_kafka_consumer_group_mapping '{\"stockprice\": \"sp2\"}'\n```\n\n## 解決方案 3：增強代碼支持（需要修改）\n\n我可以修改代碼來支持 **checkpoint path -> consumer group** 的映射，而不是 **topic -> consumer group**：\n\n```bash\n# 新的配置方式（需要代碼修改）\nairflow variables set checkpoint_consumer_group_mapping '{\n  \"s3://zhwenhaodatalake/checkpoints/sp1/stockprice/offsets/\": \"sp1\",\n  \"s3://zhwenhaodatalake/checkpoints/sp2/stockprice/offsets/\": \"sp2\"\n}'\n```\n\n## 推薦方案：\n\n我建議使用 **解決方案 2**，因為：\n1. **清晰分離**: 每個 Spark 應用有獨立的監控 DAG\n2. **獨立調度**: 可以為不同應用設置不同的執行頻率\n3. **故障隔離**: 一個應用的問題不會影響另一個\n4. **易於維護**: 配置和日誌都是獨立的\n\n您希望我實現哪種解決方案？如果選擇解決方案 3，我需要修改代碼來支持基於 checkpoint path 的 consumer group 映射。\n[Tool uses: none]",
