    "\n[Tool uses: fs_write]",
    "完美！我已經成功實現了**方案3 - 基於 checkpoint path 的 consumer group 映射**。\n\n## ✅ **方案3實現完成 - Checkpoint-Based Consumer Group Mapping**\n\n### **針對您的 sp1 & sp2 場景的配置：**\n\n```bash\n# 必要配置\nairflow variables set msk_broker_string \"b-1.zhwenhaomsk.88je25.c5.kafka.us-east-1.amazonaws.com:9092,b-2.zhwenhaomsk.88je25.c5.kafka.us-east-1.amazonaws.com:9092\"\n\n# 兩個應用的 checkpoint 路徑\nairflow variables set s3_checkpoint_paths '[\n  \"s3://zhwenhaodatalake/checkpoints/sp1/stockprice/offsets/\",\n  \"s3://zhwenhaodatalake/checkpoints/sp2/stockprice/offsets/\"\n]'\n\nairflow variables set kafka_topics '[\"stockprice\"]'\n\n# 關鍵配置：checkpoint path → consumer group 映射\nairflow variables set checkpoint_consumer_group_mapping '{\n  \"s3://zhwenhaodatalake/checkpoints/sp1/stockprice/offsets/\": \"sp1\",\n  \"s3://zhwenhaodatalake/checkpoints/sp2/stockprice/offsets/\": \"sp2\"\n}'\n```\n\n### **核心功能增強：**\n\n1. **`get_checkpoint_consumer_group_mapping()`** - 新方法支持 checkpoint path → consumer group 映射\n2. **`resolve_topic_consumer_groups()`** - 根據 checkpoint 數據動態解析 topic → consumer group 關係\n3. **衝突處理** - 如果同一 topic 出現在多個 checkpoint 中，使用最新的映射\n4. **向後兼容** - 如果沒有 checkpoint mapping，自動回退到 topic mapping 或默認 consumer group\n\n### **執行流程：**\n\n1. **讀取 Checkpoints**: 從 sp1 和 sp2 的 S3 路徑讀取 checkpoint 數據\n2. **解析映射關係**: \n   - sp1 checkpoint 的 stockprice → consumer group \"sp1\"\n   - sp2 checkpoint 的 stockprice → consumer group \"sp2\"\n3. **獨立提交**: 使用不同的 consumer group 分別提交 offsets\n4. **詳細日誌**: 顯示解析的映射關係和提交結果\n\n### **優勢：**\n\n- ✅ **應用隔離**: sp1 和 sp2 維護獨立的 offset 追蹤\n- ✅ **同 Topic 支持**: 同一個 topic 可以有多個 consumer group\n- ✅ **靈活配置**: 支持複雜的多應用場景\n- ✅ **衝突處理**: 優雅處理 topic 衝突情況\n- ✅ **向後兼容**: 不影響現有單 consumer group 設置\n\n我已經創建了專門的配置指南 `docs/sp1_sp2_scenario_config.md` 詳細說明您的場景配置。\n\n現在可以進行下一階段 - **Testing & Validation** 嗎？\n[Tool uses: none]",
    "> yes",
    "I'll proceed with the **Testing & Validation** phase to create unit tests, integration tests, and validation scripts.\n[Tool uses: fs_write]",
    "\n[Tool uses: fs_write]",
    "\n[Tool uses: fs_write]",
    "\n[Tool uses: fs_write]",
    "\n[Tool uses: fs_write]",
    "\n[Tool uses: fs_write]",
    "\n[Tool uses: fs_write]",
    "\n[Tool uses: fs_write]",
    "\n[Tool uses: execute_bash]",
    "Perfect! I've successfully completed the **Testing & Validation** phase with comprehensive test coverage:\n\n## ✅ **Testing & Validation - COMPLETED**\n\n### **Created Test Suite:**\n\n1. **Unit Tests** (`test/`):\n   - **`test_s3_checkpoint_reader.py`** - Tests S3 path parsing, file listing, content parsing, and offset extraction\n   - **`test_kafka_offset_committer.py`** - Tests single and multi-consumer group Kafka operations\n   - **`test_config_manager.py`** - Tests Airflow Variables integration and checkpoint-based consumer group resolution\n\n2. **Integration Tests** (`test_integration.py`):\n   - **S3 Integration** - Real S3 connectivity and checkpoint processing\n   - **Kafka Integration** - Real Kafka connectivity and topic validation\n   - **Configuration Integration** - End-to-end configuration validation\n   - **End-to-End Integration** - Complete workflow simulation\n\n3. **Test Data Generation** (`test_data_generator.py`):\n   - **CheckpointDataGenerator** - Creates realistic Spark checkpoint data\n   - **ScenarioDataGenerator** - Generates data for sp1/sp2 and multi-topic scenarios\n   - **TestFileGenerator** - Creates test files and configuration scripts\n\n4. **Validation Scripts** (`validate_offsets.py`):\n   - **OffsetValidator** - Comprehensive system health checks\n   - **S3 Validation** - Checkpoint reading validation\n   - **Kafka Validation** - Connectivity and topic validation\n   - **Consistency Validation** - Offset accuracy between S3 and Kafka\n\n5. **Test Runner** (`run_tests.py`):\n   - **Unified Test Execution** - Runs all tests with configurable options\n   - **Comprehensive Reporting** - Generates detailed test reports\n   - **Integration Control** - Environment variable-based test enabling\n\n### **Key Testing Features:**\n\n- ✅ **Comprehensive Coverage** - Unit, integration, and validation tests\n- ✅ **Scenario Testing** - Specific tests for sp1/sp2 scenario\n- ✅ **Mock Support** - Extensive mocking for isolated unit tests\n- ✅ **Real Environment Testing** - Optional integration tests with real AWS/Kafka\n- ✅ **Test Data Generation** - Realistic checkpoint and configuration data\n- ✅ **Automated Validation** - System health and offset accuracy checks\n- ✅ **Flexible Execution** - Configurable test runner with detailed reporting\n\n### **Usage Examples:**\n\n```bash\n# Run unit tests only\npython test/run_tests.py --unit-only\n\n# Run all tests including integration and validation\npython test/run_tests.py --integration --validation --verbose\n\n# Generate test data and run comprehensive tests\npython test/run_tests.py --generate-data --integration --validation\n\n# Run system validation independently\npython test/validate_offsets.py\n\n# Generate test data for scenarios\npython test/test_data_generator.py\n```\n\n### **Environment Variables for Integration Tests:**\n```bash\nexport RUN_S3_INTEGRATION_TESTS=true\nexport RUN_KAFKA_INTEGRATION_TESTS=true\nexport RUN_E2E_INTEGRATION_TESTS=true\nexport TEST_S3_BUCKET=your-test-bucket\nexport TEST_KAFKA_BROKERS=broker1:9092,broker2:9092\n```\n\nThe testing framework is now ready! Should I proceed with the next phase - **MWAA Deployment** - to clean up and deploy to your local MWAA environment?\n[Tool uses: none]",
    "> /save 20250725.sjon"
